# ==========================================================================
# PRIVATE assessment data - never publish.
# These describe a live personal environment in enough detail to be a
# security risk. If you run the tool inside this folder, these patterns keep
# the sensitive output from ever being committed.
# ==========================================================================

# Filled worksheet, raw evidence, and risk register (specific weaknesses)
csf-worksheet.csv
csf-worksheet.orig.csv
csf-risk-register.csv
evidence-*.md
scope.txt

# Internal policy / inventory / runbook / remediation docs (name ISP, devices, layout)
docs/
remediation-plan.md

# The detailed (non-sanitized) report. The sanitized csf-maturity-report.md is
# the one that is published; this ignore is for the detailed one if generated here.
csf-assessment-report.md

# One-time local helper scripts (not part of the published tool)
add_plain_english.py
professionalize_notes.py
fill_risk_analysis.py

# Generated / local junk
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.chk
*.bak
_draft_*.txt
